<section id="faq" class="marketing-section content-section faq" aria-labelledby="faq-title">
<div class="faq-heading"><h2 id="faq-title">Before you install.</h2></div>
<div class="faq-list">
<details>
<summary>Does the browser change my local Codex?</summary>
<p>No. The playground is local browser UI; installation is a separate terminal action.</p>
</details>
<details>
<summary>Can I run custom commands here?</summary>
<p>Native custom commands are supported; this browser demo does not execute them.</p>
</details>
<details>
<summary>Where is my layout saved?</summary>
<p>In browser storage for this origin, until cleared. Download it to keep a transferable copy.</p>
</details>
<details>
<summary>Which versions are supported?</summary>
<p>See the <a class="text-link" href="https://github.com/adrijshikhar/cxstatusline#requirements">maintained compatibility documentation</a>.</p>
</details>
<details>
<summary>Is this an official OpenAI product?</summary>
<p>No. cxstatusline is an independent project.</p>
</details>
</div>
</section>
